fixture second_ember_off_the_spikes
doc docs/adr/0015: Second Ember hears every pogo bounce, off the world as off an enemy (BUILD.md s5 Pogo: "on hitting an enemy, hazard or pogo-able surface"). An air jump and an air dash spent, then a pogo off the spikes: two air dashes after it (as pogo_resets leaves one).
room test/spikes
spawn 800 200
option votive_second_ember 1
frames 60
input
  2 jump
  5 dash
  34..59 D attack
end
expect
  at 5 event.dash=1 air_dashes=0
  mark bounce 34..59 event.pogo=1
  at bounce air_dashes=2 air_jumps=1 event.proc=1
  never 0..59 event.hazard=1
end
